Verification

The package passed 9 automated tests, its internal references passed integrity checks, and its ZIP archive was verified.

From the module directory, you can run:

python -m biosem validate
python -m unittest discover -s tests -v
python -m biosem infer examples/ant_honeydew.json

The reference inference engine works, but its likelihoods are illustrative, not calibrated using real-world training data. The next development stage is connecting actual observations and chemical measurements.

I haven’t changed or pushed anything to your live Pantheon-Prime repository⁠￼. These are additions for you to review and merge.

